NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-e2e.BuildAgentManifest kind=func
  digest=b3:bd242b02da4b7eb361623549eeec60d43eeaa274a03600ecce3a6d2ebd58627d file=executor/cmd/mcl-e2e/setup.go range=129:205 lang=go exported=true byte_range=4309:8612
  sig=func BuildAgentManifest(agentDID, fsJail, gitRepoDir string) *tool.AgentManifest
  doc=BuildAgentManifest synthesizes a Q22-compliant tool.AgentManifest pinned\nat the e2e-installed packages with deterministic synthetic digests.\n\nReal production deployments compute PackageDigest as sha256(installed\ntarball); for the harness we synthesize a stable digest from a canonical\n"<provider>:<package>@<version>" string so manifest validation passes\nwhile still being audit-stable across runs.
