NODE id=matrix/executor/cmd/mcl-e2e.newULIDLike kind=func
  digest=b3:63098cd10824c4c80cb2d1bef05a951242d18efc3604f56905c47bfb8f83a00c file=executor/cmd/mcl-e2e/envelopes.go range=125:143 lang=go exported=false byte_range=3931:4555
  sig=func newULIDLike() string
  doc=newULIDLike emits a ULID-shaped 26-char Crockford-base32 string. Not a\nstrict ULID (no monotonic guarantee across the process) but cryptographically\nrandom and stable enough for envelope IDs. Mirrors the encoding used by\noklog/ulid.
